{
  "_readme": "Single source of truth for tool/technology skills. Each skill is detected from: extensions (authored lines), files (glob on path or name), dependencies (manifest tokens, lowercase, trailing * = prefix), patterns (regex run on authored source/config). aliases are used to find the skill in job-posting text.",
